{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Korach took</b> — juxtaposed the dispute to the section of tzitzit, because it was on account of the matter of tzitzit that he disputed with Moses." "<b>ויקח קרח</b> — in gematria this is במקח רע (a bad purchase). Wealth preserved for its owner to his harm. In gematria: עשרו של קרח לרעתו (the wealth of Korach was to his harm)."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:17.681580741Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}